        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_thorus_addon", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Armor for Raven's guard", "Protection: 70 weapons • 70 arrows • 0 fire • 0 magic. After gaining access to the Temple of Adanos, take this armor from Bloodwyn’s chest near the entrance. It counts as a bandit disguise; ordinary townspeople can attack you while you wear it.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_bau_l", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Farmer's Clothing 1", "Protection: 15 weapons • 15 arrows • 0 fire • 0 magic. Buy Lobart’s farmer outfit at the beginning of the game. Doing his farm errands lowers the price.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_kdf_l", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Fire Mage's Robe", "Protection: 40 weapons • 40 arrows • 20 fire • 20 magic. Receive it after completing the Test of Fire and being accepted as a fire mage.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_bdt_h", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Heavy Bandit's Armor", "Protection: 50 weapons • 50 arrows • 0 fire • 0 magic. Buy from Huno inside the Jharkendar bandit camp. Keep it on inside the bandit camp, but take it off around ordinary citizens.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_djg_h", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Heavy Dragon Hunter Armor", "Protection: 150 weapons • 150 arrows • 100 fire • 50 magic. In chapter 5, read the Almanac in the monastery’s secret cellar and tell Bennet about the armor. Buy it from him for 20,000 gold.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_kdf_h", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Heavy Fire Robe", "Protection: 100 weapons • 100 arrows • 50 fire • 50 magic. Fire-mage progression reward from Pyrokar after the Eye of Innos has been restored.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_sld_h", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Heavy Mercenary Armor", "Protection: 80 weapons • 80 arrows • 5 fire • 10 magic. Buy from Lee after completing the Valley of Mines report and advancing to chapter 3.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_mil_m", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Heavy Militia Armor", "Protection: 70 weapons • 70 arrows • 10 fire • 10 magic. Buy from Engor in the Valley of Mines castle after reaching the castle in chapter 2.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_pal_m", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Knight's Armor", "Protection: 100 weapons • 100 arrows • 50 fire • 25 magic. Paladin-path reward after freeing Bennet and reporting to Lord Hagen.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_leather_l", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Leather Armor", "Protection: 25 weapons • 20 arrows • 5 fire • 0 magic. Buy from Matteo or Orlan, or obtain the stored suit behind Matteo’s shop. It is useful before joining a guild.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_djg_l", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Light Dragon Hunter's Armor", "Protection: 100 weapons • 100 arrows • 50 fire • 25 magic. Bennet rewards a mercenary hero after he is freed from prison in chapter 3.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_sld_l", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Light Mercenary Armor", "Protection: 30 weapons • 30 arrows • 0 fire • 0 magic. Lee gives it when you are admitted to the mercenaries.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_mil_l", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Light Militia Armor", "Protection: 40 weapons • 40 arrows • 0 fire • 0 magic. Lord Andre gives it when you join the militia.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_bdt_m", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Medium Bandit's Armor", "Protection: 35 weapons • 35 arrows • 0 fire • 0 magic. Obtain from the pirates before entering the Jharkendar bandit camp. Put it on before approaching the bandits.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
        ToolReferenceEntry("g2_item_itar_djg_m", "ARMOR AND ROBES", "Medium Dragon Hunter's Armor", "Protection: 120 weapons • 120 arrows • 75 fire • 35 magic. Learn dragon-scale harvesting before the dragon hunt. Bennet or Jan can make this armor in chapter 4 using 20 dragon scales and 12,000 gold.", source = "https://www.gothicz.net/gothic-2/predmety/zbroje/"),
